      "text": "Six screens, in order. Left pane: AI conversation. Right pane: read-only live preview. Yellow notes: what to look for, with requirement IDs.\nTop bar: UnityStack, project switcher, user. Inside a project, a left rail lists the phases; the current one is highlighted.\nOverview of the whole journey: 00-journey-overview.excalidraw. Requirements: docs/requirements/01-requirements.md and 10-core-platform.md.",
