      "updated": 1764277200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Stories go to OpenProject only after the plan's PR is merged — exactly once, even if events repeat (FR-068, FR-069).",
      "originalText": "2. Stories go to OpenProject only after the plan's PR is merged — exactly once, even if events repeat (FR-068, FR-069).",
